🎮 Game Overview

Missile Escape is a lightweight browser game featuring:

✨ Features

Smooth missile controls using JavaScript.

SVG-based obstacles for crisp, scalable graphics.

Multiple barrier types:

Static gaps

Moving horizontal/vertical barriers

Irregular shapes

Narrow tunnels

Progressive difficulty as barriers get faster and tighter.

Collision detection built using SVG coordinates.

CSS animations for bursts, movements & UI effects.

Optimized for performance so it runs smoothly on any modern browser.

🧩 Technologies Used
Tech	Usage
JavaScript (Vanilla)	Game logic, collision detection, movement controls
SVG Graphics	Drawing missile, barriers, dynamic obstacles
CSS3	Animations, layout, responsive design
HTML5	Game canvas + basic structure
🕹️ How to Play

Start the game from the live link or clone the repo.

Use your assigned arrow keys / mouse / touch (whichever you implemented) to control the missile.

Navigate through gaps between the barriers.

Avoid touching:

Barrier edges

Moving obstacles

Walls

Survive as long as possible — obstacles get harder over time!
